{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分感受句较长，S06、S07、S13的信息相对集中，观众短暂抬眼时可能来不及读完；Y在具体交代人物动机和因果关系上略充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的【】形成了明确的视觉锚点，观众即使不逐字阅读，也容易抓住每段人物心理的核心变化；感受文字虽然较长，但具体描写和分段出现的时机能帮助观众跟上音乐中的情绪转折。Y的左侧叙述在人物动机和因果解释上稍完整，但右侧短词在S03、S06、S07等段落过于密集，存在重复、跳跃和情绪标签堆叠的问题，反而不容易在有限时间里形成清晰印象。整体而言，X更像一条连续发展的心理历程，感受也更有细节和层次，而不是简单罗列情绪。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad9ea88c-affe-4e84-b76e-a7b1ca98e5eb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T015952099103Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:00:49.386169+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "019af98442a73db72fb6ab14adaa8dba7da7038d7792f8aa37575c328b1a3378", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3f